# pnpm package manager pin lives in package.json ("packageManager").
#
# Do NOT pin `store-dir` here. A hardcoded store path only works on the machine
# that created it: on any other builder it collides with pnpm's own store and
# the install dies with
#   ERR_PNPM_UNEXPECTED_STORE  Unexpected store location
# which then surfaces as a confusing "Failed to install TypeScript" /
# "Failed to load next.config.ts" from the Next build.
#
# Let pnpm pick its default store. If you ever need a specific one, override
# it per-invocation with `--store-dir`, not in a committed file.
